{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>START YOUR PARKING EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You inherit an old parking lot from your grandfather. A dusty cash register, a worn-out keychain, and impatient customers\u2026 One of the city\u2019s most troublesome lots is now in your hands. Restoring it is entirely up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parking Garage Simulator Demo</strong> was designed to let you explore the core mechanics of parking management.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMERS AND PAYMENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The people of the city are coming to your lot. Impatient, grumpy, VIP, or elderly \u2013 each customer expects smooth service. Handle car deliveries carefully, complete payments correctly, and keep them satisfied.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062880/extras/2f2dd62bc5698651231e802fe371a016.poster.avif?t=1760111879\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062880/extras/2f2dd62bc5698651231e802fe371a016.webm?t=1760111879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062880/extras/2f2dd62bc5698651231e802fe371a016.mp4?t=1760111879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEYS AND ORGANIZATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every key must be properly labeled, or chaos will follow. In this demo, you\u2019ll experience the importance of key management and see how much difference staying organized can make.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NIGHT SHIFT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the daytime rush, the night brings new challenges. Thieves threaten your lot, and it\u2019s up to you to protect vehicles with cameras, lights, and security measures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062880/extras/2fc4579e09ae9c3c62c940e10b066889.poster.avif?t=1760111879\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062880/extras/2fc4579e09ae9c3c62c940e10b066889.webm?t=1760111879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062880/extras/2fc4579e09ae9c3c62c940e10b066889.mp4?t=1760111879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BEYOND THE DEMO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parking Garage Simulator Demo is only the beginning. In the full version, you\u2019ll expand into new parking chains, manage your employees, and rise as the city\u2019s most prestigious operator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062880/extras/2270573c36512bf442a14ba821141981.poster.avif?t=1760111879\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062880/extras/2270573c36512bf442a14ba821141981.webm?t=1760111879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062880/extras/2270573c36512bf442a14ba821141981.mp4?t=1760111879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT CAN YOU TRY IN THIS DEMO?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open and run your first parking lot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve different types of customers, park their cars, and complete payments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep keys organized to prevent chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transition to the night shift and protect your lot against thieves.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keys go missing, customers lose patience, and nighttime dangers are always near\u2026 Running a parking lot isn\u2019t easy. But with the right management, you can turn a small space into a parking empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc49 <strong>Download Parking Garage Simulator Demo, share your experience, and add the full game to your wishlist!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4062880?t=1760111879","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062880/4e2bf9b96070abc849e62b985201d7a52c47913e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760111879","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062880/e5da5347addcd8d5ed876af4a7545f6cba42bb86/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760111879","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062880/e5da5347addcd8d5ed876af4a7545f6cba42bb86/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760111879","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062880/extras/209184e3a33a6bedb5590934ae5c0a2c.avif?t=1760111879\" data-has-big width=1560 height=1560 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Demo</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>START YOUR PARKING EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You inherit an old parking lot from your grandfather. A dusty cash register, a worn-out keychain, and impatient customers\u2026 One of the city\u2019s most troublesome lots is now in your hands. Restoring it is entirely up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parking Garage Simulator Demo</strong> was designed to let you explore the core mechanics of parking management.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMERS AND PAYMENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The people of the city are coming to your lot. Impatient, grumpy, VIP, or elderly \u2013 each customer expects smooth service. Handle car deliveries carefully, complete payments correctly, and keep them satisfied.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062880/extras/2f2dd62bc5698651231e802fe371a016.poster.avif?t=1760111879\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062880/extras/2f2dd62bc5698651231e802fe371a016.webm?t=1760111879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062880/extras/2f2dd62bc5698651231e802fe371a016.mp4?t=1760111879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEYS AND ORGANIZATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every key must be properly labeled, or chaos will follow. In this demo, you\u2019ll experience the importance of key management and see how much difference staying organized can make.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NIGHT SHIFT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the daytime rush, the night brings new challenges. Thieves threaten your lot, and it\u2019s up to you to protect vehicles with cameras, lights, and security measures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062880/extras/2fc4579e09ae9c3c62c940e10b066889.poster.avif?t=1760111879\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062880/extras/2fc4579e09ae9c3c62c940e10b066889.webm?t=1760111879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\